    },
    {
      "text": "生态第一，利润第二",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143306",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "与盈利能力相比，环境保护是LBH电器的首要任务。为了实现可持续生产的目标，我们投资了最先进的生产设备，并聘请了高素质的员工。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720853924",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "36px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "这些举措使我们能够降低能耗和废物排放，从而减少碳足迹。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720853924",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "36px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "你好，高速电机",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143307",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "再见，碳刷电机",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143307",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "通过广泛的市场调研和对技术趋势的密切关注，我们致力于打造用户体验更佳、能耗更低的个护家电产品。LBH电器可以帮助您以更低的能耗实现目标用户所需的风量，从而降低能源成本，保护环境。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720365293",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "36px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "人才：长期发展的驱动力",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143308",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH电器聘用年轻而充满活力的优秀人才，并通过我们的培训项目对他们进行培训，这些项目涵盖可持续行业实践和社区建设参与等方面。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720365287",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "36px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们为员工提供的价值确保他们有能力在未来找到有效的可持续解决方案。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720365287",
